Do not persist the computed maxContextTokens on the conversation

getSaveOptions() saved the context budget computed by initializeAgent into
conversations.maxContextTokens. The next turn read it back as a user-specified
value and subtracted the output reserve again, shrinking the budget every turn.
Only the user/spec value (carried by runOptions) is persisted now.

